math_text_regions.source:
$$
\vcenter{
\xymatrix{
X \ar[rd]_1 \ar[r]_-{\eta \otimes 1} &
X \otimes Y \otimes X \ar[d]^{1 \otimes \epsilon} \\
& X
}
}
\quad\text{and}\quad
\vcenter{
\xymatrix{
Y \ar[rd]_1 \ar[r]_-{1 \otimes \eta} &
Y \otimes X \otimes Y \ar[d]^{\epsilon \otimes 1} \\
& Y
}
}
$$

